# variants/base/portage/package.use/13-lua — Lua: every LUA_SINGLE_TARGET override lives here, together.
#
# The global LUA_SINGLE_TARGET is lua5-4, and these packages cannot use it:
# nginx and obs-studio declare LUA_COMPAT=( luajit ) alone, mpv ( lua5-1 luajit ),
# vlc ( lua5-1 lua5-2 ). Without the pin their `^^ ( )` has nothing to satisfy.
# Gathered from four different files, where the pattern was invisible.
#
# Numeric prefix: Portage reads this directory in sorted order and the LAST
# file wins a conflict (measured 2026-09-13), so the number is precedence, not
# decoration. Ranges: 00-09 hardware · 10-19 languages and toolchain ·
# 20-39 system and graphics · 40-49 applications · 50-69 axis and flavor
# layers · 90-99 late overrides.

